{"id":"dunkelheit","lemma":"Dunkelheit","pos":"noun","rank":1721,"glosses":["darkness"],"ipa":"/ˈdʊŋkl̩haɪ̯t/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/8/86/De-Dunkelheit.ogg/De-Dunkelheit.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"genitive":"Dunkelheit","plural":"Dunkelheiten"},"examples":[{"text":"Ich mag die Dunkelheit nicht.","en":"I don't like the dark.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to like","l":"mögen"},{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"not"}]},{"text":"Sie hat Angst vor der Dunkelheit.","en":"She's afraid of the dark.","words":[{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"has","l":"haben"},{"g":"fear"},{"g":"in front of, ahead of"},{"g":"the"},null]},{"text":"Sie ist in der Dunkelheit verschwunden.","en":"She disappeared in the dark.","words":[{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"in"},{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"disappeared"}]},{"text":"Jemand rief meinen Namen in der Dunkelheit.","en":"Somebody called my name in the dark.","words":[{"g":"someone, somebody"},{"g":"to call out","l":"rufen"},{"g":"to opine, to think"},{"g":"name","l":"Name"},{"g":"in"},{"g":"the"},null]},{"text":"Er fürchtete sich vor der Dunkelheit.","en":"He was afraid of the dark.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/760768","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"to fear","l":"fürchten"},{"g":"oneself"},{"g":"in front of, ahead of"},{"g":"the"},null]}]}